text_output=That's the key part of the focus. Landing kernel foundry make it easier for things to get up and running. The second section is about getting the agentic stack hardened, getting our microservices out, getting that feedback loop. What do we need to change? How do we prioritize things between the different usages, especially as we go to see Crescent Island landing.
